IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- INSTRUMENT: Telecommunications (Exemption from Section 54(1)(a) and Telecommunications (Dealers) Regulations) Notification 2024 (S 381/2024), made by the Minister under section 96 of the Act (the 2020 Revised Edition's number
-- for the power the 2000 Edition numbers section 73), made and first published 30 April 2024 at 5 pm, in operation 30 April 2024 ("comes into operation on 30 April 2024", paragraph 1).
-- Deposited 2026-11-04 from the e-Gazette's follow-up list into subjects/sg/telecommunications-in-vehicle-unit-exemption-notification-2024/registers/source-bundle/ (TA1999-ERP-S381-2024).
--
-- WHAT IT DOES.  Paragraph 3(1): "section 54(1)(a) of the Act does not apply to any person in respect of the sale, offer for sale or possession for sale of an in-vehicle unit"; paragraph 3(2): the Dealers Regulations
-- "do not apply to any person in respect of the sale, offer for sale or possession for sale of an in-vehicle unit"; both subject to paragraph 3(3), which takes out a person who sells an in-vehicle unit (not already installed in a vehicle)
-- to the Land Transport Authority, or imports for sale, offers for sale or possesses for sale such a unit for the purposes of a sale to the Land Transport Authority.
-- An "in-vehicle unit" is "a radio-communication device" that is or is to be installed in a vehicle, communicates with the Land Transport Authority's next-generation Electronic Road Pricing system using a band the Schedule names, and
-- is registered for sale under regulation 20(6) of the Dealers Regulations (Rg 6).
--
-- WHAT IT DOES NOT DO.  It exempts a DEALING (selling, offering for sale, possessing for sale) from s 54(1)(a) and from the Dealers Regulations.  It does not mention possession or use by a purchaser, it does not touch
-- s 53 (the licensing offence for establishing or operating a telecommunication system or service), s 55, or any receiver, and the device it describes is a transceiver on cellular, short-range and wireless-LAN bands.  It names no broadcast receiver of any kind.
-- It is a dealer's exemption for one device; the seat does not consult it.
-- Before 30 April 2024 the answer is NOTHING (the Notification is not in force).  The reading day is not modelled: made, published and in operation on one day.

-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:23 | In exercise of the powers conferred by section 96 of the
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:24 | Telecommunications Act 1999, the Minister for Communications
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:25 | and Information makes the following Notification:
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:27 | Citation and commencement
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:28 | 1. This Notification is the Telecommunications (Exemption from
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:29 | Section 54(1)(a) and Telecommunications (Dealers) Regulations)
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:30 | Notification 2024 and comes into operation on 30 April 2024.
@ref S 381/2024 paragraph 1 (citation and commencement) (src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:23-30)
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`S 381/2024 para 1: the Notification is in operation on the date` MEANS d AT LEAST (Date 30 4 2024)

-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:32 | Definitions
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:33 | 2. In this Notification —
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:34 | “E.R.P. 2.0 system” means the Land Transport Authority Global
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:35 | Navigation Satellite Systems based road‑user charging
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:36 | system known as the Next‑Generation Electronic Road
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:37 | Pricing System;
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:40 | “in-vehicle unit” means a radio‑communication device that —
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:41 | (a) is, or is to be, installed in a vehicle, and which
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:42 | communicates with the E.R.P. 2.0 system using any
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:43 | radio frequency band specified in the Schedule; and
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:44 | (b) is registered for sale under regulation 20(6) of the
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:45 | Telecommunications (Dealers) Regulations (Rg 6);
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:46 | “Land Transport Authority” means the Land Transport
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:47 | Authority of Singapore established by section 3 of the
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:48 | Land Transport Authority of Singapore Act 1995.
@ref S 381/2024 paragraph 2 (definitions) (src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:32-48)
GIVEN `the device is a radio-communication device` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the device is, or is to be, installed in a vehicle` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the device communicates with the E.R.P. 2.0 system using a radio frequency band specified in the Schedule` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the device is registered for sale under regulation 20(6) of Rg 6` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`S 381/2024 para 2: the device is an in-vehicle unit` MEANS
        `the device is a radio-communication device`
    AND (`the device is, or is to be, installed in a vehicle` AND `the device communicates with the E.R.P. 2.0 system using a radio frequency band specified in the Schedule`)
    AND `the device is registered for sale under regulation 20(6) of Rg 6`

-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:50 | Exemption in respect of sale, etc., of in-vehicle unit
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:51 | 3.—(1) Subject to sub‑paragraph (3), section 54(1)(a) of the Act
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:52 | does not apply to any person in respect of the sale, offer for sale or
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:53 | possession for sale of an in‑vehicle unit.
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:54 | (2) Subject to sub‑paragraph (3), the Telecommunications
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:55 | (Dealers) Regulations do not apply to any person in respect of the
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:56 | sale, offer for sale or possession for sale of an in‑vehicle unit.
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:57 | (3) Sub‑paragraphs (1) and (2) do not apply to a person who sells an
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:58 | in‑vehicle unit (that is not already installed in a vehicle) to the Land
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:59 | Transport Authority or imports for sale, offers for sale or possesses
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:60 | for sale such an in‑vehicle unit for the purposes of sale to the Land
-- src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:61 | Transport Authority.
@ref S 381/2024 paragraph 3 (exemption in respect of sale, etc., of in-vehicle unit) (src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:50-61)
GIVEN `the person sells an in-vehicle unit that is not already installed in a vehicle to the Land Transport Authority` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person imports for sale, offers for sale or possesses for sale such an in-vehicle unit for the purposes of sale to the Land Transport Authority` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`S 381/2024 para 3(3): the exemption of sub-paragraphs (1) and (2) does not apply to the person` MEANS
        `the person sells an in-vehicle unit that is not already installed in a vehicle to the Land Transport Authority`
    OR `the person imports for sale, offers for sale or possesses for sale such an in-vehicle unit for the purposes of sale to the Land Transport Authority`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the dealing is a sale, an offer for sale or possession for sale` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the device is an in-vehicle unit` IS A BOOLEAN
      `sub-paragraph (3) takes the person out` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`S 381/2024 para 3(1): section 54(1)(a) of the Act does not apply to the person in respect of the dealing` MEANS
        `S 381/2024 para 1: the Notification is in operation on the date` d
    AND `the dealing is a sale, an offer for sale or possession for sale`
    AND `the device is an in-vehicle unit`
    AND NOT `sub-paragraph (3) takes the person out`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the dealing is a sale, an offer for sale or possession for sale` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the device is an in-vehicle unit` IS A BOOLEAN
      `sub-paragraph (3) takes the person out` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`S 381/2024 para 3(2): the Telecommunications (Dealers) Regulations do not apply to the person in respect of the dealing` MEANS
        `S 381/2024 para 1: the Notification is in operation on the date` d
    AND `the dealing is a sale, an offer for sale or possession for sale`
    AND `the device is an in-vehicle unit`
    AND NOT `sub-paragraph (3) takes the person out`

