@ref S 381/2024 the Schedule (authorised radio frequency bands for in-vehicle unit) (src:TA1999-ERP-S381-2024:63-103)
GIVEN item IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`S 381/2024 Schedule: the application type of the item` MEANS
    BRANCH IF item EQUALS 0 THEN NOTHING
           IF item EQUALS 1 THEN JUST "Third Generation wireless mobile telecommunications technology"
           IF item EQUALS 2 THEN JUST "Fourth Generation wireless mobile telecommunications technology"
           IF item EQUALS 3 THEN JUST "Dedicated short range communications"
           IF item EQUALS 4 THEN JUST "Dedicated short range communications"
           IF item EQUALS 5 THEN JUST "Bluetooth"
           IF item EQUALS 6 THEN JUST "Wireless Local Area Network"
           IF item EQUALS 7 THEN JUST "Wireless Local Area Network"
           IF item EQUALS 8 THEN JUST "Near Field Communication"
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

GIVEN item IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE (LIST OF STRING)
`S 381/2024 Schedule: the authorised radio frequency bands and the maximum approved field strength or power for the item` MEANS
    BRANCH IF item EQUALS 0 THEN NOTHING
           IF item EQUALS 1 THEN JUST (LIST "880-915 MHz: 24 dBm", "925-960 MHz: 24 dBm", "1,920-1,980 MHz: 24 dBm", "2,110-2,170 MHz: 24 dBm")
           IF item EQUALS 2 THEN JUST (LIST "880-915 MHz: 23 dBm", "925-960 MHz: 23 dBm", "1,710-1,785 MHz: 23 dBm", "1,805-1,880 MHz: 23 dBm", "2,500-2,570 MHz: 23 dBm", "2,620-2,690 MHz: 23 dBm")
           IF item EQUALS 3 THEN JUST (LIST "5,855-5,875 MHz: 100 mW EIRP")
           IF item EQUALS 4 THEN JUST (LIST "5,875-5,925 MHz: 2 W EIRP")
           IF item EQUALS 5 THEN JUST (LIST "2,400-2,483.50 MHz: 100 mW EIRP")
           IF item EQUALS 6 THEN JUST (LIST "5,150-5,350 MHz: 200 mW EIRP")
           IF item EQUALS 7 THEN JUST (LIST "5,470-5,725 MHz: 1 W EIRP")
           IF item EQUALS 8 THEN JUST (LIST "13.553-13.567 MHz: 94 dBμV/m at 10m")
           OTHERWISE NOTHING
